      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay i'll call them but they're closed right now since its late. i feel bad just sitting here while he's so sleepy... is there anything i can do at home to help him perk up or some kind of electrolyte drink i can get at the pharmacy that would work better than juice? i just dont want to drive him all the way to the hospital if i can manage it here for a few hours.",
